  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Doesn't Squeak\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mouse_ears_01_helm_icon.png\" title=\"Mouse ears 01 helm icon.png\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"64\" src=\"/images/recovered/Mouse_ears_01_helm_icon.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Piece: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Helm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Movement Speed: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">+2%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Class: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Defense Rating: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">varies with item level\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>This helm only comes from the <a href=\"/wiki/Wishing_Well\" title=\"Wishing Well\">Wishing Well</a>. It still drops. The pair is <a href=\"/wiki/Squeaks\" title=\"Squeaks\">Squeaks</a>. The Well-only list is on <a href=\"/wiki/Well-Only_Rainbows\" title=\"Well-Only Rainbows\">Well-Only Rainbows</a>.</p>\n<a name=\"Attributes:\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Attributes: </span></h2>\n<ul><li>+ Endurance\n</li><li>+ Intellect\n</li><li>+ Health\n</li><li>+ Mana\n</li><li>+ Poison Damage Resistance\n</li><li>+ Divine Damage Resistance\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
